  "duration_s": 578.344828,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上一集咱们说到屠呦呦拿了诺贝尔科学奖，全世界都在给他鼓掌，可他到现在依然不是中国科学院的院士。有人可能会问，院士有那么重要吗？对屠呦呦来说，也许不重要，他一辈子不看重这个，但这事儿背后的道理让人心里不是滋味。屠呦呦是个三无科学家，哪三无没有博士学位，没有留学经历，没有院士头衔。中国学术圈最看重的那些东西，他一样都不占他。一九五五年毕业于北京医学院，就是新中国培养的第一批大学生。没读过博士没出过国，镀金，毕业后直接进了中医研究院，白大褂一穿就是六十多年，可就是这么一个三无老太太，拿下了中国第一个诺贝尔科学生。你说讽刺不讽刺比评不上院士，更让人心疼的是，他这一辈子对家人的亏欠。前面说了，接下五二三任务的时候，他两个女儿大的四岁，小的还不会走路。他把大女儿送去全托，把小女儿送回宁波老家，托给外婆带，这一送就是好多年。几年后，他回老家看小女儿，孩子已经跟他生份了。站在外婆身后不敢上前接大女儿回家时，孩子也跟他生叔了半天，喊不出一声妈，哪个当妈的看见这场面，心不会碎，可他抹掉眼泪，转身又回了实验室。他后来不怎么提这些事儿，只说孩子长大了会理解的。可这句话背后藏着多少个不眠之夜，只有他自己知道，对女儿是亏欠，对自己的母亲是一辈子的遗憾。那些年搞研究，他忙的脚不沾地。母亲病重的时候，她在实验室里实在走不开，想着等忙完这一阵再回去，可等他忙完，母亲人已经没了，他连母亲最后一面都没见上这件事，他后来几乎不提，但了解他的人都说，那是他心里永远的遗憾，对家人亏欠，对自己他更狠，以身试药。那事儿上一集说了，他自己第一个喝下去，可你知道吗？长期接触乙醚，那些有毒试剂，他的肝脏早就受了损伤，听力也越来越差，跟人说话总得侧着耳朵仔细听，可他呢九十多岁了，还坚持去研究所指导科研，带着团队研究青蒿素的新用途，想让这味药能治疗红斑狼疮等更多疾病救更多的病人。记者堵在门口，想采访他他摆摆手，说自己就是个搞科研的工作，就是爱好。他老伴挡在门前，几乎是恳求说都八十多岁的人了，什么名头都不在乎了别再打扰了，你再看看这反差。国外的公共广播机构举办大众票选活动，把他评为二十世纪最伟大的科学家之一，跟那些改变人类历史的大科学家相提并论。诺贝尔颁奖台上，副主席跪地给他举话筒。非洲的孩子因为他的药活了下来，全世界都在感谢他。可在国内呢整整四十年，没人知道他是谁。在单位里，他一直是最不起眼的那一个申报院士，好几次每次都落选。理由呢说法很多，有人说他没有博士学位，有人说他的研究不够系统。有人说成果是集体的，不能算他一个人的合着。在有些人眼里救了几百万人的命，还顶不上一张文凭。更扎心的是，在国外把他捧上神坛之前，咱们普通人根本不知道屠呦呦是谁，合着诺贝尔奖砸过来才恍然大悟。原来咱们身边藏着这么牛的人物，我就纳闷了，这么伟大的科学家，这么动人的故事，为啥是外国人先发现呢？难道不是该咱们自己骄傲的讲给全世界听吗？咱们的媒体每天忙忙碌碌，今天这个明星上热搜，明天那个网红炒话题，咋就把这些真正的英雄给漏了。有人说过一句扎心的话，这个真正有本事的人往往不吭声，那些不会混圈子。不会搞应酬，只会闷头干事的人，就容易被忽略。这话听着刺耳，可想想屠呦呦的遭遇又让人没法反驳。他一辈子埋头在实验室里不混圈子，不搞应酬，一门心思搞研究，结果却要靠外国人的认可，才能被自己人发现。更让人揪心的是，现在还有多少像屠呦呦这样的人，他们没留过洋，没进过什什么核心圈子只会闷头干事，不会溜须拍马，他们的成就可能不比任何人差，却因为不会来事，就只能默默无闻。咱们到底缺了点啥？为啥自家的英雄要靠外人来发掘那些埋头苦干的科研人？该怎么才能真正被看见？屠呦呦的名字是他父亲从诗经里取的，悠呦鹿鸣使野之好，蒿蒿就是青蒿。他父亲大概也想不到，这个叫悠悠的姑娘，这辈子真的和青蒿死磕到底了。他就像一株默默生长在田野里的青蒿不起眼，不张扬，没有耀眼的光环，没有华丽的言辞，却用一生的坚守为几百万人撑起了一把生命之伞。有些人需要一顶帽子来证明自己，有些人本身就是一座碑，屠呦呦属于后者，他不需要谁的施舍和承认。他早就把自己活成了那株救命的青蒿，生于平凡，却至于万千生灵。其实啊咱们中国像屠呦呦这样的人还有很多。你想想搞原子弹的邓稼先，搞清弹的渔民，搞杂交水稻的袁隆平，搞核潜艇的黄旭华，还有那些在戈壁滩上隐姓埋名几十年，连名字都不能往外说的人，他们哪一个不是拿命在拼，哪一个不是把一辈子都搭进去了？可我们普通老百姓又真正知道他们几个的故事。这些年，我每次看到这些人物的资料，心里都不是滋味，他们干的是惊天动地的大事。可我们的孩子张嘴闭嘴追的都是这个明星。那个网红连邓稼先是谁？黄旭华是谁都不知道。说实话，我做这期视频的时候，心里一直有个念头，这些人的故事不能就这么被埋了。咱们这代人要是不把他们记住，将来孩子问起来谁来讲？所以今天我想给大家推荐一本书叫国之脊梁。这本书里写了几十位中国科学家的真实故事。从两弹一星到杂交水稻，从青蒿素到核潜艇，那些你听过名字，但不知道事迹的你连名字都没听过的英雄全在这本书里。我翻开这本书的时候，说实话好几次差点没忍住。你知道他们那代人是怎么干事的吗？没有加班费，没有房子、没有职称，甚至连名字都不能公开，就凭着一腔热血，把国家急需的东西硬生生给搞了出来。这本书不是那种干巴巴的教科书，全是一个一个真实的故事，语言很朴实。咱们中老年人看着不累，孩子也能看懂，我就把链结放在视频左下角了，感兴趣的朋友点进去，直接拍，拿到手，细细品读。如果你也觉得屠呦呦这样的人值得被更多人记住。点个赞，把这条视频转出去，让更多人看见。中国有一位没评上院士的诺贝尔奖得主，他救了几百万人的命。评论区说说你的看法，咱们的英雄到底该怎么被看见？收藏起来，下次跟孩子们讲起中国科学家的时候，别忘了讲讲屠呦呦的故事。关注我，下一期咱们接着讲那些干成了大事，却很少有人认识的中国人。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 4470,
      "text": "上一集咱们说到屠呦呦拿了诺贝尔科学奖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00002",
      "start_ms": 5110,
      "end_ms": 6930,
      "text": "全世界都在给他鼓掌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00003",
      "start_ms": 7410,
      "end_ms": 10630,
      "text": "可他到现在依然不是中国科学院的院士。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00004",
      "start_ms": 12070,
      "end_ms": 13210,
      "text": "有人可能会问，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00005",
      "start_ms": 13690,
      "end_ms": 15130,
      "text": "院士有那么重要吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00006",
      "start_ms": 15330,
      "end_ms": 16430,
      "text": "对屠呦呦来说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00007",
      "start_ms": 16790,
      "end_ms": 17810,
      "text": "也许不重要，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00008",
      "start_ms": 18470,
      "end_ms": 20330,
      "text": "他一辈子不看重这个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00009",
      "start_ms": 20990,
      "end_ms": 24570,
      "text": "但这事儿背后的道理让人心里不是滋味。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00010",
      "start_ms": 25390,
      "end_ms": 27030,
      "text": "屠呦呦是个三无科学家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00011",
      "start_ms": 27390,
      "end_ms": 29905,
      "text": "哪三无没有博士学位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00012",
      "start_ms": 30460,
      "end_ms": 31780,
      "text": "没有留学经历，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00013",
      "start_ms": 32020,
      "end_ms": 33340,
      "text": "没有院士头衔。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00014",
      "start_ms": 33920,
      "end_ms": 37360,
      "text": "中国学术圈最看重的那些东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00015",
      "start_ms": 37420,
      "end_ms": 39000,
      "text": "他一样都不占他。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00016",
      "start_ms": 39000,
      "end_ms": 41480,
      "text": "一九五五年毕业于北京医学院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00017",
      "start_ms": 41840,
      "end_ms": 44720,
      "text": "就是新中国培养的第一批大学生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00018",
      "start_ms": 45140,
      "end_ms": 47520,
      "text": "没读过博士没出过国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00019",
      "start_ms": 47520,
      "end_ms": 48000,
      "text": "镀金，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00020",
      "start_ms": 48420,
      "end_ms": 50580,
      "text": "毕业后直接进了中医研究院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00021",
      "start_ms": 50960,
      "end_ms": 53380,
      "text": "白大褂一穿就是六十多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00022",
      "start_ms": 54300,
      "end_ms": 56380,
      "text": "可就是这么一个三无老太太，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00023",
      "start_ms": 56780,
      "end_ms": 59765,
      "text": "拿下了中国第一个诺贝尔科学生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00024",
      "start_ms": 60680,
      "end_ms": 64280,
      "text": "你说讽刺不讽刺比评不上院士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00025",
      "start_ms": 64300,
      "end_ms": 66210,
      "text": "更让人心疼的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00026",
      "start_ms": 66210,
      "end_ms": 69265,
      "text": "他这一辈子对家人的亏欠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00027",
      "start_ms": 69930,
      "end_ms": 70650,
      "text": "前面说了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00028",
      "start_ms": 70670,
      "end_ms": 72410,
      "text": "接下五二三任务的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00029",
      "start_ms": 72550,
      "end_ms": 74510,
      "text": "他两个女儿大的四岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00030",
      "start_ms": 74710,
      "end_ms": 75995,
      "text": "小的还不会走路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00031",
      "start_ms": 76690,
      "end_ms": 78230,
      "text": "他把大女儿送去全托，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00032",
      "start_ms": 78450,
      "end_ms": 80290,
      "text": "把小女儿送回宁波老家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00033",
      "start_ms": 80590,
      "end_ms": 81695,
      "text": "托给外婆带，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00034",
      "start_ms": 82100,
      "end_ms": 84005,
      "text": "这一送就是好多年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00035",
      "start_ms": 84330,
      "end_ms": 84910,
      "text": "几年后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00036",
      "start_ms": 85070,
      "end_ms": 86495,
      "text": "他回老家看小女儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00037",
      "start_ms": 86780,
      "end_ms": 88105,
      "text": "孩子已经跟他生份了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00038",
      "start_ms": 88350,
      "end_ms": 92510,
      "text": "站在外婆身后不敢上前接大女儿回家时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00039",
      "start_ms": 92810,
      "end_ms": 95330,
      "text": "孩子也跟他生叔了半天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00040",
      "start_ms": 95330,
      "end_ms": 96585,
      "text": "喊不出一声妈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00041",
      "start_ms": 96920,
      "end_ms": 99725,
      "text": "哪个当妈的看见这场面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00042",
      "start_ms": 100020,
      "end_ms": 100925,
      "text": "心不会碎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00043",
      "start_ms": 101780,
      "end_ms": 103080,
      "text": "可他抹掉眼泪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00044",
      "start_ms": 103160,
      "end_ms": 104805,
      "text": "转身又回了实验室。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00045",
      "start_ms": 105630,
      "end_ms": 107545,
      "text": "他后来不怎么提这些事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00046",
      "start_ms": 107860,
      "end_ms": 109985,
      "text": "只说孩子长大了会理解的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00047",
      "start_ms": 110680,
      "end_ms": 114375,
      "text": "可这句话背后藏着多少个不眠之夜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00048",
      "start_ms": 115220,
      "end_ms": 116675,
      "text": "只有他自己知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00049",
      "start_ms": 117080,
      "end_ms": 118375,
      "text": "对女儿是亏欠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00050",
      "start_ms": 119140,
      "end_ms": 121965,
      "text": "对自己的母亲是一辈子的遗憾。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00051",
      "start_ms": 122770,
      "end_ms": 123990,
      "text": "那些年搞研究，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00052",
      "start_ms": 124250,
      "end_ms": 125655,
      "text": "他忙的脚不沾地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00053",
      "start_ms": 126370,
      "end_ms": 127910,
      "text": "母亲病重的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00054",
      "start_ms": 128130,
      "end_ms": 130205,
      "text": "她在实验室里实在走不开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00055",
      "start_ms": 130670,
      "end_ms": 133475,
      "text": "想着等忙完这一阵再回去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00056",
      "start_ms": 133890,
      "end_ms": 134930,
      "text": "可等他忙完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00057",
      "start_ms": 135210,
      "end_ms": 136625,
      "text": "母亲人已经没了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00058",
      "start_ms": 137210,
      "end_ms": 140450,
      "text": "他连母亲最后一面都没见上这件事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00059",
      "start_ms": 140670,
      "end_ms": 142195,
      "text": "他后来几乎不提，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00060",
      "start_ms": 142730,
      "end_ms": 144295,
      "text": "但了解他的人都说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00061",
      "start_ms": 144820,
      "end_ms": 146635,
      "text": "那是他心里永远的遗憾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00062",
      "start_ms": 147140,
      "end_ms": 148355,
      "text": "对家人亏欠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00063",
      "start_ms": 148640,
      "end_ms": 150285,
      "text": "对自己他更狠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00064",
      "start_ms": 151510,
      "end_ms": 152530,
      "text": "以身试药。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00065",
      "start_ms": 152530,
      "end_ms": 154435,
      "text": "那事儿上一集说了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00066",
      "start_ms": 155230,
      "end_ms": 157075,
      "text": "他自己第一个喝下去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00067",
      "start_ms": 157890,
      "end_ms": 158785,
      "text": "可你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00068",
      "start_ms": 159450,
      "end_ms": 161070,
      "text": "长期接触乙醚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00069",
      "start_ms": 161070,
      "end_ms": 162375,
      "text": "那些有毒试剂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00070",
      "start_ms": 162860,
      "end_ms": 165365,
      "text": "他的肝脏早就受了损伤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00071",
      "start_ms": 165870,
      "end_ms": 167275,
      "text": "听力也越来越差，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00072",
      "start_ms": 167790,
      "end_ms": 171525,
      "text": "跟人说话总得侧着耳朵仔细听，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00073",
      "start_ms": 172370,
      "end_ms": 174135,
      "text": "可他呢九十多岁了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00074",
      "start_ms": 174410,
      "end_ms": 176810,
      "text": "还坚持去研究所指导科研，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00075",
      "start_ms": 176970,
      "end_ms": 180245,
      "text": "带着团队研究青蒿素的新用途，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00076",
      "start_ms": 180790,
      "end_ms": 186435,
      "text": "想让这味药能治疗红斑狼疮等更多疾病救更多的病人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00077",
      "start_ms": 187210,
      "end_ms": 188250,
      "text": "记者堵在门口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00078",
      "start_ms": 188390,
      "end_ms": 191785,
      "text": "想采访他他摆摆手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00079",
      "start_ms": 192360,
      "end_ms": 195310,
      "text": "说自己就是个搞科研的工作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00080",
      "start_ms": 195310,
      "end_ms": 196085,
      "text": "就是爱好。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00081",
      "start_ms": 196440,
      "end_ms": 197755,
      "text": "他老伴挡在门前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00082",
      "start_ms": 198320,
      "end_ms": 201920,
      "text": "几乎是恳求说都八十多岁的人了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00083",
      "start_ms": 201980,
      "end_ms": 205565,
      "text": "什么名头都不在乎了别再打扰了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00084",
      "start_ms": 206040,
      "end_ms": 207635,
      "text": "你再看看这反差。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00085",
      "start_ms": 208350,
      "end_ms": 212815,
      "text": "国外的公共广播机构举办大众票选活动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00086",
      "start_ms": 213160,
      "end_ms": 217120,
      "text": "把他评为二十世纪最伟大的科学家之一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00087",
      "start_ms": 217240,
      "end_ms": 220765,
      "text": "跟那些改变人类历史的大科学家相提并论。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00088",
      "start_ms": 221370,
      "end_ms": 222625,
      "text": "诺贝尔颁奖台上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00089",
      "start_ms": 223050,
      "end_ms": 224965,
      "text": "副主席跪地给他举话筒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00090",
      "start_ms": 225560,
      "end_ms": 228315,
      "text": "非洲的孩子因为他的药活了下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00091",
      "start_ms": 228830,
      "end_ms": 230345,
      "text": "全世界都在感谢他。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00092",
      "start_ms": 230790,
      "end_ms": 233410,
      "text": "可在国内呢整整四十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00093",
      "start_ms": 233670,
      "end_ms": 235135,
      "text": "没人知道他是谁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00094",
      "start_ms": 235740,
      "end_ms": 236645,
      "text": "在单位里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00095",
      "start_ms": 236920,
      "end_ms": 240970,
      "text": "他一直是最不起眼的那一个申报院士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00096",
      "start_ms": 240970,
      "end_ms": 243150,
      "text": "好几次每次都落选。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00097",
      "start_ms": 243410,
      "end_ms": 244890,
      "text": "理由呢说法很多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00098",
      "start_ms": 245310,
      "end_ms": 246990,
      "text": "有人说他没有博士学位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00099",
      "start_ms": 247070,
      "end_ms": 249130,
      "text": "有人说他的研究不够系统。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00100",
      "start_ms": 249610,
      "end_ms": 251530,
      "text": "有人说成果是集体的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00101",
      "start_ms": 251950,
      "end_ms": 254770,
      "text": "不能算他一个人的合着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00102",
      "start_ms": 254770,
      "end_ms": 258170,
      "text": "在有些人眼里救了几百万人的命，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00103",
      "start_ms": 258810,
      "end_ms": 260810,
      "text": "还顶不上一张文凭。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00104",
      "start_ms": 261270,
      "end_ms": 262310,
      "text": "更扎心的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00105",
      "start_ms": 262550,
      "end_ms": 264810,
      "text": "在国外把他捧上神坛之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00106",
      "start_ms": 265290,
      "end_ms": 267870,
      "text": "咱们普通人根本不知道屠呦呦是谁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00107",
      "start_ms": 268410,
      "end_ms": 272260,
      "text": "合着诺贝尔奖砸过来才恍然大悟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00108",
      "start_ms": 272580,
      "end_ms": 275740,
      "text": "原来咱们身边藏着这么牛的人物，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00109",
      "start_ms": 276000,
      "end_ms": 276940,
      "text": "我就纳闷了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00110",
      "start_ms": 277260,
      "end_ms": 278960,
      "text": "这么伟大的科学家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00111",
      "start_ms": 279180,
      "end_ms": 280640,
      "text": "这么动人的故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00112",
      "start_ms": 280740,
      "end_ms": 282760,
      "text": "为啥是外国人先发现呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00113",
      "start_ms": 283180,
      "end_ms": 286400,
      "text": "难道不是该咱们自己骄傲的讲给全世界听吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00114",
      "start_ms": 286980,
      "end_ms": 288900,
      "text": "咱们的媒体每天忙忙碌碌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00115",
      "start_ms": 289380,
      "end_ms": 291120,
      "text": "今天这个明星上热搜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00116",
      "start_ms": 291580,
      "end_ms": 293460,
      "text": "明天那个网红炒话题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00117",
      "start_ms": 293900,
      "end_ms": 296560,
      "text": "咋就把这些真正的英雄给漏了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00118",
      "start_ms": 297360,
      "end_ms": 299320,
      "text": "有人说过一句扎心的话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00119",
      "start_ms": 299680,
      "end_ms": 302890,
      "text": "这个真正有本事的人往往不吭声，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00120",
      "start_ms": 303490,
      "end_ms": 304905,
      "text": "那些不会混圈子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00121",
      "start_ms": 305510,
      "end_ms": 306610,
      "text": "不会搞应酬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00122",
      "start_ms": 307030,
      "end_ms": 308890,
      "text": "只会闷头干事的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00123",
      "start_ms": 309170,
      "end_ms": 310450,
      "text": "就容易被忽略。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00124",
      "start_ms": 311290,
      "end_ms": 312610,
      "text": "这话听着刺耳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00125",
      "start_ms": 312930,
      "end_ms": 316370,
      "text": "可想想屠呦呦的遭遇又让人没法反驳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00126",
      "start_ms": 316830,
      "end_ms": 320270,
      "text": "他一辈子埋头在实验室里不混圈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00127",
      "start_ms": 320430,
      "end_ms": 321290,
      "text": "不搞应酬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00128",
      "start_ms": 321610,
      "end_ms": 323070,
      "text": "一门心思搞研究，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00129",
      "start_ms": 323490,
      "end_ms": 325650,
      "text": "结果却要靠外国人的认可，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00130",
      "start_ms": 325910,
      "end_ms": 327270,
      "text": "才能被自己人发现。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00131",
      "start_ms": 327930,
      "end_ms": 329410,
      "text": "更让人揪心的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00132",
      "start_ms": 329830,
      "end_ms": 332830,
      "text": "现在还有多少像屠呦呦这样的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00133",
      "start_ms": 333090,
      "end_ms": 334150,
      "text": "他们没留过洋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00134",
      "start_ms": 334490,
      "end_ms": 338000,
      "text": "没进过什什么核心圈子只会闷头干事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00135",
      "start_ms": 338220,
      "end_ms": 339380,
      "text": "不会溜须拍马，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00136",
      "start_ms": 339780,
      "end_ms": 342920,
      "text": "他们的成就可能不比任何人差，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00137",
      "start_ms": 343640,
      "end_ms": 345060,
      "text": "却因为不会来事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00138",
      "start_ms": 345320,
      "end_ms": 347280,
      "text": "就只能默默无闻。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00139",
      "start_ms": 347600,
      "end_ms": 349320,
      "text": "咱们到底缺了点啥？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00140",
      "start_ms": 349560,
      "end_ms": 355660,
      "text": "为啥自家的英雄要靠外人来发掘那些埋头苦干的科研人？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00141",
      "start_ms": 356040,
      "end_ms": 358220,
      "text": "该怎么才能真正被看见？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00142",
      "start_ms": 359000,
      "end_ms": 362540,
      "text": "屠呦呦的名字是他父亲从诗经里取的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00143",
      "start_ms": 363080,
      "end_ms": 365270,
      "text": "悠呦鹿鸣使野之好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00144",
      "start_ms": 365310,
      "end_ms": 367465,
      "text": "蒿蒿就是青蒿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00145",
      "start_ms": 367960,
      "end_ms": 369685,
      "text": "他父亲大概也想不到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00146",
      "start_ms": 370130,
      "end_ms": 371615,
      "text": "这个叫悠悠的姑娘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00147",
      "start_ms": 372100,
      "end_ms": 374875,
      "text": "这辈子真的和青蒿死磕到底了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00148",
      "start_ms": 375670,
      "end_ms": 380815,
      "text": "他就像一株默默生长在田野里的青蒿不起眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00149",
      "start_ms": 381120,
      "end_ms": 381745,
      "text": "不张扬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00150",
      "start_ms": 382030,
      "end_ms": 383350,
      "text": "没有耀眼的光环，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00151",
      "start_ms": 383470,
      "end_ms": 384890,
      "text": "没有华丽的言辞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00152",
      "start_ms": 385430,
      "end_ms": 391195,
      "text": "却用一生的坚守为几百万人撑起了一把生命之伞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00153",
      "start_ms": 392110,
      "end_ms": 395135,
      "text": "有些人需要一顶帽子来证明自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00154",
      "start_ms": 395750,
      "end_ms": 398185,
      "text": "有些人本身就是一座碑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00155",
      "start_ms": 398620,
      "end_ms": 400395,
      "text": "屠呦呦属于后者，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00156",
      "start_ms": 400820,
      "end_ms": 402855,
      "text": "他不需要谁的施舍和承认。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00157",
      "start_ms": 403390,
      "end_ms": 406490,
      "text": "他早就把自己活成了那株救命的青蒿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00158",
      "start_ms": 406830,
      "end_ms": 407870,
      "text": "生于平凡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00159",
      "start_ms": 408270,
      "end_ms": 410005,
      "text": "却至于万千生灵。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00160",
      "start_ms": 411210,
      "end_ms": 415895,
      "text": "其实啊咱们中国像屠呦呦这样的人还有很多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00161",
      "start_ms": 416310,
      "end_ms": 418530,
      "text": "你想想搞原子弹的邓稼先，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00162",
      "start_ms": 418670,
      "end_ms": 419885,
      "text": "搞清弹的渔民，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00163",
      "start_ms": 420230,
      "end_ms": 422005,
      "text": "搞杂交水稻的袁隆平，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00164",
      "start_ms": 422380,
      "end_ms": 424080,
      "text": "搞核潜艇的黄旭华，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00165",
      "start_ms": 424480,
      "end_ms": 428445,
      "text": "还有那些在戈壁滩上隐姓埋名几十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00166",
      "start_ms": 428910,
      "end_ms": 430905,
      "text": "连名字都不能往外说的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00167",
      "start_ms": 431330,
      "end_ms": 433345,
      "text": "他们哪一个不是拿命在拼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00168",
      "start_ms": 433750,
      "end_ms": 436305,
      "text": "哪一个不是把一辈子都搭进去了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00169",
      "start_ms": 436760,
      "end_ms": 441195,
      "text": "可我们普通老百姓又真正知道他们几个的故事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00170",
      "start_ms": 443080,
      "end_ms": 443825,
      "text": "这些年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00171",
      "start_ms": 444350,
      "end_ms": 446690,
      "text": "我每次看到这些人物的资料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00172",
      "start_ms": 447030,
      "end_ms": 448345,
      "text": "心里都不是滋味，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00173",
      "start_ms": 449110,
      "end_ms": 451975,
      "text": "他们干的是惊天动地的大事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00174",
      "start_ms": 452930,
      "end_ms": 456590,
      "text": "可我们的孩子张嘴闭嘴追的都是这个明星。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00175",
      "start_ms": 456610,
      "end_ms": 459375,
      "text": "那个网红连邓稼先是谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00176",
      "start_ms": 459760,
      "end_ms": 462055,
      "text": "黄旭华是谁都不知道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00177",
      "start_ms": 462550,
      "end_ms": 463275,
      "text": "说实话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00178",
      "start_ms": 463640,
      "end_ms": 465320,
      "text": "我做这期视频的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00179",
      "start_ms": 465480,
      "end_ms": 467285,
      "text": "心里一直有个念头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00180",
      "start_ms": 467930,
      "end_ms": 470945,
      "text": "这些人的故事不能就这么被埋了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00181",
      "start_ms": 471820,
      "end_ms": 474005,
      "text": "咱们这代人要是不把他们记住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00182",
      "start_ms": 474510,
      "end_ms": 476745,
      "text": "将来孩子问起来谁来讲？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00183",
      "start_ms": 477660,
      "end_ms": 483055,
      "text": "所以今天我想给大家推荐一本书叫国之脊梁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00184",
      "start_ms": 483990,
      "end_ms": 488145,
      "text": "这本书里写了几十位中国科学家的真实故事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00185",
      "start_ms": 488730,
      "end_ms": 491500,
      "text": "从两弹一星到杂交水稻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00186",
      "start_ms": 491520,
      "end_ms": 493525,
      "text": "从青蒿素到核潜艇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00187",
      "start_ms": 493890,
      "end_ms": 495210,
      "text": "那些你听过名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00188",
      "start_ms": 495210,
      "end_ms": 500765,
      "text": "但不知道事迹的你连名字都没听过的英雄全在这本书里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00189",
      "start_ms": 501260,
      "end_ms": 502745,
      "text": "我翻开这本书的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00190",
      "start_ms": 503130,
      "end_ms": 506115,
      "text": "说实话好几次差点没忍住。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00191",
      "start_ms": 506740,
      "end_ms": 509005,
      "text": "你知道他们那代人是怎么干事的吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00192",
      "start_ms": 509390,
      "end_ms": 510290,
      "text": "没有加班费，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00193",
      "start_ms": 510490,
      "end_ms": 512490,
      "text": "没有房子、没有职称，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00194",
      "start_ms": 512830,
      "end_ms": 514945,
      "text": "甚至连名字都不能公开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00195",
      "start_ms": 515490,
      "end_ms": 517150,
      "text": "就凭着一腔热血，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00196",
      "start_ms": 517370,
      "end_ms": 521245,
      "text": "把国家急需的东西硬生生给搞了出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00197",
      "start_ms": 521760,
      "end_ms": 524720,
      "text": "这本书不是那种干巴巴的教科书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00198",
      "start_ms": 524840,
      "end_ms": 526975,
      "text": "全是一个一个真实的故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00199",
      "start_ms": 527720,
      "end_ms": 528965,
      "text": "语言很朴实。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00200",
      "start_ms": 529640,
      "end_ms": 531585,
      "text": "咱们中老年人看着不累，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00201",
      "start_ms": 531850,
      "end_ms": 532935,
      "text": "孩子也能看懂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00202",
      "start_ms": 533720,
      "end_ms": 536495,
      "text": "我就把链结放在视频左下角了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00203",
      "start_ms": 537250,
      "end_ms": 539090,
      "text": "感兴趣的朋友点进去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00204",
      "start_ms": 539090,
      "end_ms": 539795,
      "text": "直接拍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00205",
      "start_ms": 540190,
      "end_ms": 540750,
      "text": "拿到手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00206",
      "start_ms": 540850,
      "end_ms": 542115,
      "text": "细细品读。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00207",
      "start_ms": 543070,
      "end_ms": 546570,
      "text": "如果你也觉得屠呦呦这样的人值得被更多人记住。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00208",
      "start_ms": 546810,
      "end_ms": 547465,
      "text": "点个赞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00209",
      "start_ms": 548390,
      "end_ms": 549945,
      "text": "把这条视频转出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00210",
      "start_ms": 550320,
      "end_ms": 552115,
      "text": "让更多人看见。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00211",
      "start_ms": 552920,
      "end_ms": 557245,
      "text": "中国有一位没评上院士的诺贝尔奖得主，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00212",
      "start_ms": 557680,
      "end_ms": 559200,
      "text": "他救了几百万人的命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00213",
      "start_ms": 559460,
      "end_ms": 561160,
      "text": "评论区说说你的看法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00214",
      "start_ms": 561200,
      "end_ms": 563895,
      "text": "咱们的英雄到底该怎么被看见？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00215",
      "start_ms": 564510,
      "end_ms": 565390,
      "text": "收藏起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00216",
      "start_ms": 565770,
      "end_ms": 568350,
      "text": "下次跟孩子们讲起中国科学家的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00217",
      "start_ms": 568550,
      "end_ms": 570490,
      "text": "别忘了讲讲屠呦呦的故事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00218",
      "start_ms": 570910,
      "end_ms": 571570,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00219",
      "start_ms": 571890,
      "end_ms": 575840,
      "text": "下一期咱们接着讲那些干成了大事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7d8477f6d742b9b9_s00220",
      "start_ms": 576160,
      "end_ms": 578285,
      "text": "却很少有人认识的中国人。"
    }
  ],
